<<speech "maera">>  like the one any woman wears who must fight in armour not built for her body.<</speech>>

//Any woman.//

The words hang in the dim corridor like dust motes in a sunbeam.

<<speech "mc">>I am not  <</speech>>

<<speech "maera">>Go,<</speech>>

