[[The body in the mirror|warrior_queen_day_1_12]]


:: warrior_queen_day_1_12

The full length mirror in the bath chamber has been my enemy for weeks. I avoid it. Angle past it. Dress and undress with my back to it. But Aldric's words sit in my skull like a blade, //built upon a frame that no longer exists//, and I owe the truth at least a glance.

I turn to face the glass.

